ution, plastic waste, a littered park, and deforestation scenes]</figcaption>\n\n    <div class=\"quadrant pollution\">\n      <div class=\"road-line one\"></div>\n      <div class=\"road-line two\"></div>\n      <div class=\"car car-top\"></div>\n      <div class=\"car car-bottom\"></div>\n      <div class=\"smoke smoke-a\"></div>\n      <div class=\"smoke smoke-b\"></div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"quadrant plastic\">\n      <div class=\"waste bag\"></div>\n      <div class=\"waste paper\"></div>\n      <div class=\"waste bottle red\"></div>\n      <div class=\"waste bottle pink\"></div>\n      <div class=\"waste bottle yellow\"></div>\n      <div class=\"small-trash\"></div>\n      <div class=\"small-trash cyan\"></div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"quadrant park\">\n      <div class=\"tree\">\n        <div class=\"crown\"></div>\n        <div class=\"trunk\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bench\">\n        <div class=\"slat\"></div>\n        <div class=\"slat\"></div>\n        <div class=\"slat\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"park-litter litter-one\"></div>\n      <div class=\"park-litter litter-two\"></div>\n      <div class=\"park-litter litter-three\"></div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"quadrant forest\">\n      <div class=\"water-speck speck-top\"></div>\n      <div class=\"water-speck speck-bottom\"></div>\n      <div class=\"stump stump-one\"></div>\n      <div class=\"stump stump-two\"></div>\n      <div class=\"stump stump-three\"></div>\n      <div class=\"stump stump-four\"></div>\n      <div class=\"stump stump-five\"></div>\n      <div class=\"forest-stick\"></div>\n    </div>\n  </figure>\n\n  <div class=\"note note-rubbish\">\n    Rubbish makes the\n    <span class=\"second\">park messy and dirty.</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"note note-trees\">\n    Trees help keep the<br>\n    air clean.<br>\n    We should not cut down<br>\n    too many trees.\n  </div>\n\n  <h2 class=\"bottom-heading\">Let's protect our Earth!